---
---

<section class="section security" id="security">
	<div class="container security-grid">
		<div>
			<span class="eyebrow">03 — Proof</span>
			<h2>Every build ends with proof.</h2>
			<p class="section-sub">
				Before we hand anything back, it gets scanned, tested and reviewed — and you get a report you can actually
				read, with fixes applied and re-verified.
			</p>
			<div class="security-points">
				<div>
					<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
					</svg>
					<p>
						<strong style="color: var(--text);">Plain-language findings.</strong>
						No jargon dumps. You get what is risky, what it means for you, and what to do about it.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
					</svg>
					<p>
						<strong style="color: var(--text);">Fixes, then retest.</strong>
						Remediation is applied and the result is re-verified before you ever see the final report.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
					</svg>
					<p>
						<strong style="color: var(--text);">Reports you can act on.</strong>
						Scan scope, findings, severity and next steps — formatted for your team or your home setup.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="security-panel">
			<div class="security-panel-head">
				<span>Assessment scope</span>
				<em>Ready</em>
			</div>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<span>Network posture scan</span>
					<span class="check">✓</span>
					<span class="status">Passed</span>
				</li>
				<li>
					<span>Web application checks</span>
					<span class="check">✓</span>
					<span class="status">Passed</span>
				</li>
				<li>
					<span>Cloud &amp; account posture</span>
					<span class="check">✓</span>
					<span class="status">Passed</span>
				</li>
				<li>
					<span>IoT / smart device audit</span>
					<span class="check">✓</span>
					<span class="status">Passed</span>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
